WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.417
01  Open Learner profile from the course's TA actions menu.

2
00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:13.917
02  Tell the tutor how you prefer explanations and practice to be presented.

3
00:00:13.917 --> 00:00:17.000
